### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| portfolio_id | Portfolio Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | portfolio_id |
| name | Name | string | Human-readable fictional business name with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| manager_id | Manager Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | manager_id |
| base_currency | Base Currency | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | base_currency |
| mandate | Mandate | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | mandate |
| branch | Branch | string | Primary test segmentation only; shared-price defects or other evidence can affect several segments simultaneously. Allowed values: counterparty_breach, failed_settlement, future_limit, issuer_breach, normal, pending_settlement, price_exception. | branch |

